## 🏛️ Enterprise Production Roadmap & Design Trade-offs

To ensure zero-friction local evaluation without external cloud dependencies (PostgreSQL clusters, Redis brokers, Auth0 tenants), local defaults were intentionally simplified:

| Component | Portfolio Implementation | Enterprise Production Status |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Authentication & AuthZ** | OAuth2 Bearer Token + JWT + RBAC + API Keys | ✅ Integrated (`backend/app/middleware/auth.py`) |
| **Rate Limiting** | Distributed Redis ZSET Token-Bucket + Local Fallback | ✅ Integrated (`backend/app/middleware/rate_limit.py`) |
| **Infrastructure / Orchestration**| Automated GitHub Actions CI/CD + Kubernetes HPA Helm Charts | ✅ Integrated (`.github/workflows/ci-cd.yml`, `deployment/k8s/`) |
| **Persistence Tier** | Async SQLAlchemy + PostgreSQL / SQLite Pooling | ✅ Integrated (`backend/app/db/session.py`) |
| **Audit Logging** | Immutable append-only audit log stream | ✅ Integrated (`src/fraud_detection/history/`) |
| **Model Registry** | Versioned artifact schema + SHA256 integrity validation | ✅ Integrated (`models/champion/`, `models/registry.json`) |
| **Observability** | Prometheus Metrics + Kolmogorov-Smirnov Data Drift Monitor | ✅ Integrated (`src/fraud_detection/monitoring/`) |

---

## ⌨️ Analyst Keyboard Shortcuts

In the live Queue Triage workbench (`/queue`), compliance analysts can use high-velocity hotkeys for rapid transaction review:

* `J` / `K` — Navigate focus highlight down / up the transaction queue table
* `Enter` — Open deep case investigation for the active transaction
* `A` — Approve transaction (`APPROVED`)
* `D` — Decline transaction (`DECLINED`)
* `M` — Flag transaction for ongoing monitoring (`APPROVED_WITH_MONITORING`)
* `?` — Toggle keyboard shortcuts reference modal
